# The ending credits (Joseph Song's page, 2026-09-26). Run: tools/qa/eventcheck.py tools/qa/cases/credits.jsonl --shots DIR
# The real post-champion flow, as SetWarpsToRollCredits leaves it (docs/music/research/06-kanto-credits-timeline.md):
# INDIGO PLATEAU (11,6) with VAR_MAP_SCENE_INDIGO_PLATEAU_EXTERIOR 1, the quest log empty, and on the main menu
# gDisableMapMusicChangeOnMapLoad 2 and FLAG_DONT_SHOW_MAP_NAME_POPUP (sSpecialFlags bit 0). CONTINUE then loads the map
# through CB2_LoadMap, ON_TRANSITION's playbgm MUS_CREDITS really plays, and ON_FRAME walks the rival out and calls DoCredits.
# sCreditsMgr+6 is scrcmdidx: while script command N is on screen it holds N+1. Command 61 is the last SPECIAL THANKS,
# 62 the POKeMON Thunder Yellow / Joseph Song page, 63 a 52-frame gap, 64 the copyright, 65 THE END and 66 WAITBUTTON.
# Frames count from the first frame of CB2_Credits: page 62 from 12857 to 13103, THE END from 13460, WAITBUTTON from 13764;
# MUS_CREDITS ends at about 13531. How THE END falls against the song, against v0.8.0: tools/qa/creditstime.py.
{"name": "credits_joseph_song", "edit": ["warp IndigoPlateau_Exterior 11 6", "var VAR_MAP_SCENE_INDIGO_PLATEAU_EXTERIOR 1", "noquestlog"], "menu": ["poke gDisableMapMusicChangeOnMapLoad 2", "poke sSpecialFlags 1"], "leave_menu_only": true, "steps": ["waitcb2 CB2_Credits 3000", "wait 60", "expect song mus_credits", "wait 12640", "shot special_thanks", "expect deref sCreditsMgr 6 = 62", "wait 220", "shot joseph_song", "expect cb2 CB2_Credits", "expect deref sCreditsMgr 6 = 63", "expect song mus_credits", "wait 600", "shot the_end", "expect cb2 CB2_Credits", "expect deref sCreditsMgr 6 = 66", "wait 300", "expect deref sCreditsMgr 6 = 67"]}
